nsulting, and project management services makes it a trusted partner for regional governments, investors, and developers. About the Role We’re looking for a creative and detail-oriented professional to join our sustainability team at Egis Bangalore. This role is ideal for someone passionate about sustainability, design, and storytelling — someone who can bring technical data to life through compelling visuals and clear documentation. 

